// kiln-fn-install copies this file into the function's package (package main) next to a generated main(). It
// serves the function's Handler on $PORT, runs its Scheduled handler for `kiln-fn-run`, and reports telemetry to
// $KILN_OTLP_SOCKET following the Kiln telemetry contract (contracts/telemetry/README.md), encoded like the other
// runtimes: request spans named by the ServeMux pattern, panics, outgoing HTTP calls and scheduled runs. Standard
// library only. Identifiers starting with "kiln" and the Event type are reserved for it.

